    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100">

                <pb facs="0219" n="115" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg115"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/1641.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-05-02T17:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 2, 1913—5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The President’s message of recognition<anchor n="1" xml:id="d100-f1"/> was
                    delivered today to President Yuan. The Minister for Foreign Aifairs has already
                    telegraphed to Washington President Yuan’s expression of gratification.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d100-f1" n="1" xml:id="d100-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram of April 6, ante.</p>
            </note>
